  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the panang curry paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped ferment-kimchi, dried apricots, chicken broth, red wine, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir well to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine pot and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro.",
    "Cook poultry to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F before serving."
